<title>BRAZIL: Embratel nine month profit at 327 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Embratel nine month profit at 327 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil long-distance telecommunications monopoly Embratel issued its accumulated profits for the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>			    1996		 1996</p>
<p>    revenue	   1,393,450,000     930,919,000</p>
<p>    profit		326,927,000     171,795,000</p>
<p>    profit shr	   69,21	     36,37</p>
<p>Note - Revenue figures are after tax.</p>
<p>Note - Profit per share figures are per 1,000 share lots.</p>
<p>-- Adrian Dickson, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 232 4411</p>
</text>
